{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kriraghor API: M02 KYC",
    "description": "A member uploads the NID front, back and a selfie, then submits the number, date of birth and legal name; the master reviews it on the KYC desk (masked data, an audited file view, an audited 60-second reveal) and approves it with the full rubric; the member role becomes active and the identity fields are copied to the account.\n\nUnattended: `node postman/run-m02.js` (kriraghor_test database; fixtures in postman/fixtures).\n\nRebuild this file with: node postman/build-collection-m02.js",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminAccessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "frontId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "backId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "selfieId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "documentId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
